flowchart TD
    E[Chronological event: source, destination, time, relation, attributes]
    E --> P[Offline typed key-value tokenization: two hashes + ordered bigrams]
    P --> K[Typed KV encoder: shared 5303 x 64 table, type/numeric features, field attention]
    K --> F[Frozen FP32 identity lookup at inference; differentiable encoding in training]
    F --> Q[Masked-relation query embedding]
    F --> H[Observed history embeddings]
    E --> R[GPU history rings: 8 records per endpoint]
    R --> W[Causal planner: 4+4 endpoint quota, recency fill, current query]
    Q --> W
    H --> W
    W --> G[Two causal event-line-graph GAT layers: 128 dimensions]
    G --> C[Residual causal CNN: kernel 3, dilations 1,2,4]
    C --> A[Importance attention pooling: active context]
    A --> N[Novelty + GPU count-min rarity + learned write gate]
    A --> Z[256-to-64 event compression]
    Z --> S[Admitted evictions into 8-slot compressed short-memory rings]
    N --> S
    S --> T[Merge recent short tokens; role and time features]
    T --> C2[Second pass through the shared causal CNN]
    C2 --> SA[Query-conditioned short-memory attention]
    A --> SA
    SA --> U[Gated fusion with active context]
    A --> U
    U --> M[Per-endpoint affine scan: fast/slow 128-D state with elapsed-time decay]
    N --> M
    M --> D[Endpoint-gated memory read]
    U --> O[Relation reconstruction head: 10 classes]
    D --> O
    F --> B[Bilinear endpoint-pair plausibility head]
    O --> L[Relation cross-entropy + 0.1 pair anomaly score]
    B --> L
    L --> V[Benign calibration + node evidence aggregation]
    V --> X[Node anomaly scores and alerts]
